{
  "description": "The party cases of the layout model (docs/spec/parties.md#commands). Each case builds a grid of content cards from state, then runs its steps in order: each step calls one party command with params. A step that returns names the reply that the command gives, with color_token naming the theme token party-1 to party-6 that the first party takes (docs/spec/parties.md#commands). A step that errors names the exact text of the refusal (docs/spec/parties.md#commands). The owning test in packages/workbench runs these cases against the party module.",
